OL,3,GNEWSAEmpty historic building used as
OL,4,Atoilet, locals say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn empty, historic harbour building is
OL,7,Fbeing used as a toilet, locals say.
OL,9,FResidents on social media said the
OL,10,Fabandoned Customs House in Maryport,
OL,11,FCumbria, which is close to the shore,
OL,12,Fwas having human waste and used toilet
OL,13,Fpaper left in it.
OL,15,FThe office building was built in the
OL,16,Flate 1830s for managing trade as the
OL,17,Fshipyard became established as an
OL,18,Fofficial port, before being closed in
OL,19,Fthe 1960s after the port was shut to
OL,20,Ftraffic.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
